    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You summon a concentrated cloud of Daegoxian spores, which renders living creatures docile and agreeable. Any creature that enters the cloud or begins its turn within the cloud must succeed at a Will save or be @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.7PPRS6krnvaTHbxh]{Fascinated} for [[/r 1d4]] rounds. A creature that succeeds at this save is immune to the effects of Daegoxian spore cloud for 24 hours.</p>"
